        {
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "He kept the same appointment with the same square of earth.",
          "pause_after": 0.5
        },
        {
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "The neighbour stopped watching. There is nothing interesting about a man who waters dirt.",
          "pause_after": 0.6
        },
        {
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "And underneath \u2014 quietly, patiently, in a place no one had thought to look \u2014",
          "pause_after": 0.4
        },
        {
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "the seed was doing all of its work.",
          "pause_after": 0.7
